d;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:11px;padding:16px 44px 0}\n.c{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #E3E3EC;border-radius:12px;padding:16px}\n.c.hi{border-color:#2454F0;border-width:2.5px;grid-column:1 / -1}\n.ck{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2454F0;margin-bottom:8px}\n.cv{font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600}\n"}, {"name": "08-verdict", "html": "<div class=\"rail\"><span class=\"pill\">08 / 08</span><span>THE VERDICT</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;color:#8A8A99\">WHAT ACTUALLY CHANGED</span></div><div class=\"hr\"></div><div class=\"ttl\">Legibility is solved.<br><span class=\"ac\">Being right is not.</span></div><div class=\"cards\"><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"ck\">SHORT DISPLAY TEXT</div><div class=\"cv\">Tie. Thumbnails and quote graphics are no longer a reason to pick GPT.</div></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"ck\">DENSE AND FINE TEXT</div><div class=\"cv\">Still GPT, and it is not close once the type gets small.</div></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"ck\">SPEED</div><div class=\"cv\">Dead heat at ~92s. The budget model was the slowest of all three.</div></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"ck\">LIKENESS</div><div class=\"cv\">Both held my face. Nano followed the brief more literally.</div></div><div class=\"c hi\"><div class=\"ck\">THE PART THAT ACTUALLY COSTS YOU</div><div class=\"cv\">A model can render text perfectly and fill it with confident nonsense. A beautiful wrong infographic ships. A blurry one never leaves your desktop.</div></div></div><div class=\"ftr\"><span>@TYLERREEDAI</span><span>ALL 17 RE-RUN 2026-08-19, NOTHING CHERRY PICKED</span></div>", "extra": "\n.ttl{padding:12px 44px 0;font-size:40px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1.5px;line-height:1.08}\n.lead{padding:12px 44px 0;font-size:19px;color:#5A5A68;line-height:1.42}\n.lead.sm{font-size:17px;padding-top:10px}\n.duel{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:16px 44px 0;flex:0 0 auto;align-items:flex-start}\n.side{flex:1;displa